WEBVTT

49:02.883 --> 49:04.343
That's not what happened!

49:04.468 --> 49:07.638
Yes, it is! They all attacked me
and she threw my sword in the river.

49:07.763 --> 49:08.931
- Liar!
- Shut up!

49:09.056 --> 49:10.432
ROBERT: Enough!

49:10.557 --> 49:13.477
He tells me one thing,
she tells me another.

49:13.602 --> 49:15.854
Seven hells!
What am I to make of this?

49:18.106 --> 49:20.817
- Where's your other daughter, Ned?
- In bed, asleep.

49:20.943 --> 49:22.945
She's not.

49:23.070 --> 49:25.447
Sansa, come here, darling.

49:28.659 --> 49:30.661
(MURMURING)
